## 9. Conclusion

MangoCode's solution combines efficient candidate blocking, multilingual normalization, deterministic similarity features, gradient-boosting ensemble classification, and global consistency resolution to address noisy business entity matching across multiple sources.

The approach is designed to maintain high precision while substantially reducing the computational cost of comparing millions of entity records.

The final system produces the required competition outputs:

```text
candidate_pairs.tsv
matching_results.tsv
```

and performs inference entirely offline using information contained within the competition dataset.
